                },
                {
                  "id": "0VOdaR5KYHe0",
                  "text": "https://help.figma.com/hc/en-us/articles/38978644498199-AI-workflows-collection-Refine-your-components-and-variables-for-the-Figma-agent",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "id": "kkIyR1cOq9vO",
                      "text": "변수 설정 관련 페이지",
                      "children": [],
